{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object nearby then take it, process it, move to task, recharge battery. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = RechargeBattery    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />",
